# C7: member-side change of spec.replicas (what the kthena autoscaler / HPA does), without and with the retain label
# state: c6 with static weights, k014-m2 holds 3 replicas
+ km k014-m2 patch modelserving c6 --type=merge -p '{"spec":{"replicas":5}}'   (no retain label on the template)
